{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/1421","id":4004182589,"node_id":"PR_kwDOO5D6p87uqvo9","html_url":"https://github.com/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pull/1421","diff_url":"https://github.com/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pull/1421.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pull/1421.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/issues/1421","number":1421,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"feat(method-map): add visual display posture runtime mapping","user":{"login":"Samsen879","id":172257175,"node_id":"U_kgDOCkRvlw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/172257175?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879","html_url":"https://github.com/Samsen879","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## Summary\n\nCloses #1410.\n\nAdds visual/display/rights/fallback posture mapping to `QuestionRuntimePayload` for the governed 9709 runtime payload artifacts. The payload contract now exposes normalized top-level posture fields:\n\n- `visual_posture`: `not_required`, `required_ready`, `required_blocked`\n- `display_posture`: `ready`, `visual_blocked`, `rights_blocked`, `fallback_only`\n- `fallback_posture`, `student_facing_availability`, and `visual_display_governance`\n\nThe generated all-3530 read model preserves all governed rows while distinguishing row presence from student-facing display/attempt availability. Current generated counts are `ready: 2672`, `rights_blocked: 159`, `visual_blocked: 699`, with `not_required: 2672`, `required_ready: 159`, and `required_blocked: 699` visual posture counts.\n\n## Validation\n\n- `npm test -- --runInBand scripts/method-map/__tests__/question-runtime-payload-schema.test.js scripts/method-map/__tests__/question-runtime-payload-artifact-adapter.test.js scripts/method-map/__tests__/question-runtime-payload-all-3530.test.js --verbose`\n  - 3 suites passed, 27 tests passed\n- `git diff --check`\n  - passed\n- `npm run workflow:codex-preflight -- --json`\n  - exited 0; warnings only for expected dirty worktree before commit and branch naming scope\n\n## Notes\n\nThe all-3530 validator remains `blocked` only for the pre-existing semantic-unavailable taxonomy condition. It now has 15 checks, 14 pass, 1 blocked, 0 failed, and all 3530 payload rows validate.\n","created_at":"2026-07-07T05:22:40Z","updated_at":"2026-07-07T05:54:14Z","closed_at":"2026-07-07T05:54:14Z","merged_at":"2026-07-07T05:54:14Z","merge_commit_sha":"8a87e5c633a1cc80b6d47ca6705bf572f5256a03","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/1421/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/1421/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/issues/1421/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/statuses/db92230866dd7039962274bf00be540f7e0616de","head":{"label":"Samsen879:feat/issue-1410","ref":"feat/issue-1410","sha":"db92230866dd7039962274bf00be540f7e0616de","user":{"login":"Samsen879","id":172257175,"node_id":"U_